OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 23 MAY
OL,4,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,5,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,6,     GIt's the year 1527. As imperial
OL,7,     Gtroops storm Rome, its musical
OL,8,     Glife is thrown into crisis.
OL,9,G1400FRecord Review
OL,10,     GAndrew McGregor with the best new
OL,11,     Gclassical releases, joined by
OL,12,     Gcomposer Soosan Lolavar and
OL,13,     Gpianist Joanna MacGregor, who
OL,14,     Gsurveys recordings of Brahms's
OL,15,     GPiano Concerto No. 2.
OL,16,G1600FSound of Cinema
OL,17,     GA weekly celebration of
OL,18,     Goutstanding film and TV scores
OL,19,     Gwith Edith Bowman. Joining her
OL,20,     Gthis week, composer John Harle
OL,21,     Gtalks about a classic movie score
OL,22,     Gin Harmonising Hollywood.
